/URI (data:application/json;charset=utf-8,%7B%22openapi%22%3A%223.1.0%22%2C%22info%22%3A%7B%22title%22%3A%22Routes%20API%22%2C%22version%22%3A%22v2%22%7D%2C%22servers%22%3A%5B%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fapi.kpler.com%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Production%20Server%22%7D%2C%7B%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fkong.dev.galil.io%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Development%20Server%22%7D%5D%2C%22tags%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22Routes%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22For%20a%20quick%20introduction%20with%20practical%20examples%2C%20see%20the%20%3Ca%20href%3D'https%3A%2F%2Fdevelopers.kpler.com%2Fapi%2Ftutorials%2Froutes'%20target%3D'_blank'%20style%3D'text-decoration%3A%20underline%3B%20font-style%3A%20italic%3B%20color%3A%20%23007bff%3B'%3ERoutes%20API%20tutorial%3C%2Fa%3E.%22%7D%5D%2C%22paths%22%3A%7B%22%2Fv2%2Fmaritime%2Froutes%22%3A%7B%22get%22%3A%7B%22tags%22%3A%5B%22Routes%22%5D%2C%22summary%22%3A%22Get%20route%22%2C%22operationId%22%3A%22getRoute%22%2C%22parameters%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%22originType%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Defines%20how%20the%20origin%20location%20is%20specified%20and%20used%20as%20the%20starting%20point%20of%20the%20estimated%20route.%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22imo%22%2C%22mmsi%22%2C%22vesselUid%22%2C%22coordinates%22%2C%22port%22%5D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22originValue%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Specifies%20the%20origin%20location%20used%20as%20the%20starting%20point%20of%20the%20estimated%20route.%20Its%20format%20and%20meaning%20depend%20on%20the%20selected%20originType%3A%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20imo%20%E2%80%93%20for%20example%209271248%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20mmsi%20%E2%80%93%20for%20example%20257739000%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20vesselUid%20%E2%80%93%20identifier%20of%20the%20vessel%20as%20assigned%20by%20MarineTraffic%20\(for%20example%20308459\)%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20coordinates%20%E2%80%93%20provided%20as%20longitude%2Clatitude%20\(for%20example%20-170.2%2C10.12345\)%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20port%20%E2%80%93%20accepts%20either%20a%20UN%2FLOCODE%20\(for%20example%20USHOU\)%20or%20a%20port%20identifier%20assigned%20by%20MarineTraffic%20\(for%20example%20919\)%5Cn%5CnNote%3A%20When%20the%20origin%20is%20specified%20using%20a%20vessel%20identifier%20\(imo%2C%20mmsi%2C%20or%20vesselUid\)%2C%20the%20routing%20engine%20factors%20in%20the%20vessel's%20actual%20dimensions%20\(length%2C%20beam%2C%20draft\)%20and%20excludes%20any%20route%20segment%20the%20vessel%20cannot%20physically%20transit.%20For%20example%2C%20a%20vessel%20too%20large%20for%20the%20Panama%20Canal%20will%20not%20be%20routed%20through%20it%2C%20even%20if%20that%20would%20otherwise%20be%20the%20shortest%20path.%5Cn%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22destinationType%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Defines%20how%20the%20destination%20location%20is%20specified.%20The%20selected%20location%20is%20used%20as%20the%20end%20point%20of%20the%20estimated%20route.%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22coordinates%22%2C%22port%22%5D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22destinationValue%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Specifies%20the%20destination%20location%20used%20as%20the%20end%20point%20of%20the%20estimated%20route.%20Its%20format%20and%20meaning%20depend%20on%20the%20selected%20destinationType%3A%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20coordinates%20%E2%80%93%20provided%20as%20longitude%2Clatitude%20\(for%20example%20-170.2%2C10.12345\)%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20port%20%E2%80%93%20accepts%20either%20a%20UN%2FLOCODE%20\(for%20example%20USHOU\)%20or%20a%20port%20identifier%20assigned%20by%20MarineTraffic%20\(for%20example%20919\)%5Cn%22%2C%22required%22%3Atrue%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22avoidCanals%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22List%20of%20canals%20to%20strictly%20avoid%20when%20estimating%20the%20route.%20The%20estimated%20route%20will%20never%20pass%20through%20the%20specified%20canals.%22%2C%22required%22%3Afalse%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22KIEL%22%2C%22PANAMA%22%2C%22SUEZ%22%5D%7D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22avoidZones%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22List%20of%20zones%20to%20avoid%20when%20estimating%20the%20route.%20Avoidance%20is%20soft%3A%20the%20route%20estimation%20attempts%20to%20minimise%20time%20spent%20inside%20the%20specified%20zones%2C%20but%20full%20avoidance%20may%20not%20be%20possible%20for%20all%20routes.%22%2C%22required%22%3Afalse%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22array%22%2C%22items%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22enum%22%3A%5B%22ECA%22%2C%22HRA%22%5D%7D%7D%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22startDate%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Start%20date%20and%20time%20used%20for%20route%20estimation%2C%20in%20ISO%208601%20format%20\(YYYY-MM-DDTHH%3AMM%3ASSZ\)%2C%20for%20example%202025-12-22T00%3A00%3A00Z.%20If%20not%20specified%2C%20the%20time%20of%20the%20API%20call%20\(UTC\)%20is%20used%20as%20the%20start%20time.%22%2C%22required%22%3Afalse%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%2C%22pattern%22%3A%22%5E%5C%5Cd%7B4%7D-%5C%5Cd%7B2%7D-%5C%5Cd%7B2%7DT%5C%5Cd%7B2%7D%3A%5C%5Cd%7B2%7D%3A%5C%5Cd%7B2%7DZ%24%22%7D%2C%22example%22%3A%222025-12-22T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22speed%22%2C%22in%22%3A%22query%22%2C%22description%22%3A%22Speed%20used%20to%20estimate%20the%20route's%20ETA%2C%20expressed%20in%20knots.%20Accepts%20an%20integer%20or%20decimal%20value%20\(for%20example%2017%20or%2012.5\).%20This%20parameter%20is%20optional%3A%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20If%20provided%2C%20it%20overrides%20any%20other%20speed%20source%20and%20is%20used%20directly%20for%20the%20ETA%20calculation.%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20If%20omitted%20and%20a%20vessel%20identifier%20is%20specified%2C%20the%20vessel's%20actual%20average%20speed%20profile%20is%20used.%5Cn%E2%80%A2%20If%20omitted%20and%20no%20vessel%20identifier%20is%20specified%2C%20a%20default%20speed%20profile%20is%20used.%5Cn%22%2C%22required%22%3Afalse%2C%22schema%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22string%22%7D%2C%22example%22%3A%2212.5%22%7D%5D%2C%22responses%22%3A%7B%22200%22%3A%7B%22description%22%3A%22Routes%20request%20returned%20successfully%22%2C%22content%22%3A%7B%22application%2Fjson%22%3A%7B%22schema%22%3A%7B%22%24ref%22%3A%22%23%2Fcomponents%2Fschemas%2FRoute%22%2C%22example%22%3A%7B%22distance%22%3A2196%2C%22distanceEca%22%3A357%2C%22distanceHra%22%3A0%2C%22canalCrossing%22%3A%5B%22PANAMA%22%5D%2C%22startDate%22%3A%222025-12-11T00%3A00%3A00Z%22%2C%22endDate%22%3A%222025-12-18T23%3A55%3A59Z%22%2C%22route%22%3A%22LINESTRING%20\(-95.27004%2029.72779%2C%20-95.20308%2029.739%2C%20-95.18739%2029.74534%2C%20-95.16933%2029.74685%2C%20-95.15493%2029.73739%2C%20-95.12462%2029.73417%2C%20-95.10211%2029.74519%2C%20-95.09284%2029.75629%2C%20-95.08789%2029.76278%2C%20-95.08122%2029.76376%2C%20-95.06885%2029.75768%2C%20-95.05684%2029.7375%2C%20-95.04525%2029.73168%2C%20-95.02785%2029.72973%2C%20-95.02119%2029.72383%2C%20-95.02096%2029.70899%2C%20-95.01467%2029.70196%2C%20-94.99781%2029.69858%2C%20-94.98178%2029.68426%2C%20-94.95622%2029.61492%2C%20-94.89934%2029.53891%2C%20-94.86579%2029.49529%2C%20-94.80826%2029.37994%2C%20-94.79787%2029.36245%2C%20-94.78349%2029.34887%2C%20-94.7658%2029.34116%2C%20-94.70352%2029.34388%2C%20-94.62783%2029.31227%2C%20-94.52451%2029.23995%2C%20-94.40408%2029.14964%2C%20-93.83747%2028.82049%2C%20-93.70423%2028.73949%2C%20-93.32459%2028.49876%2C%20-92.87381%2028.20987%2C%20-92.7407%2028.05383%2C%20-92.55707%2027.84636%2C%20-92.25769%2027.55483%2C%20-91.6776%2026.98834%2C%20-91.56005%2026.87273%2C%20-91.40064%2026.71452%2C%20-91.11758%2026.44784%2C%20-90.32359%2025.68084%2C%20-89.74424%2025.2081%2C%20-89.53933%2025.03393%2C%20-89.13775%2024.66829%2C%20-88.69896%2024.26151%2C%20-88.13749%2023.72607%2C%20-87.46532%2023.19059%2C%20-86.30035%2022.